00042:       "fact": "HandlerHashSymbol converts non-Symbol objects responding to id; otherwise keeps input key, without its own strict data lookup. Explicit handler before first matching insertion-ordered conditional; missing returns nil; copy resolves at copy time and reuses chosen handler, no future live alias linkage. Source registration statements differ from expanded runtime identities.",
