00053:       "lines": [
00054:         1,
00055:         704
00056:       ],
00057:       "fact": "Ordinary Give is gated by non-egg count, so egg-only lacks command but fainted non-egg qualifies. Register eligibility from utility/handler differs stored direct registration; already registered ordinary item can expose unregister. Important icon additionally requires important and handler qualification. Filter entry resets cursor only with predicate; wrapper restores all original positions on normal selected/cancel return. Use result2 defers selected field item to pause; cancellation after earlier successful use need not preserve cumulative true.",
