00073:       ],
00074:       "fact": "Normal Item menu filters egg and mail. Item Use routes machine/general helper, Hyper filter uses Scent data flag. MilkDrink/Softboiled request floor(source.totalhp/5), require source HP>request and different eligible target; source loses request even target gains less due cap. BoxLink opening needs current scene permission+item+map gate; FLY cancellation recreates scene without restoring permission. Nested storage preserves aliased party objects.",
