00159:       "fact": "Full registry and all concrete species callbacks read. Hoopa/Furfrou getForm returns0 on nil/expired time, onSetForm updates timestamp after caller-supplied callback. Rotom first matching appliance move replaced/forgotten and Thundershock lastmove fallback; Kyurem exact Glaciate/ScaryFace↔IceBurn/FreezeShock/FusionFlare/FusionBolt with existence/known guards; Necrozma form1 SunsteelStrike/form2 MoongeistBeam, base forgets both then Confusion ifempty; Calyrex specialmove matching and base accessible learnset filtering plus fallback. No claim unavailable Move/Species records received.",
